#. 【面白い物】
msgctxt "0001 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[something interesting]"
msgstr ""

#. …十神クン、面白い物って？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What do you mean, something interesting?"
msgstr ""

#. 見てみろ、このファイルだ…
msgctxt "0003 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Take a look at this..."
msgstr ""

#. あそこの中途半端に偉そうな机の上に
#. 置いてあったんだが…
msgctxt "0004 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It was on top of that pathetically ostentatious desk."
msgstr ""

#. 第７８期生…在学生名簿…？
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Class #78...Student Registry...?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺達１５人と戦刃むくろのプロフィールが
#. ファイリングされている…
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "It contains profiles for all of us...and Mukuro."
msgstr ""

#. どうやら、<CLT 3>第７８期生<CLT>とは、
#. 俺達の事を指すらしいな…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Apparently <CLT 3>class #78<CLT>...refers to us."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ…前に霧切さんの部屋で見つけた
#. 戦刃むくろのプロフィールって…
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Wait, when we found Mukuro's profile in Kyoko's\n"
"room..."
msgstr ""

#. そうだな…あそこにも<CLT 3>“第７８期生”<CLT>とあったな…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "That's right. It also mentioned <CLT 3>class #78<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、霧切のヤツが、
#. このファイルから破り取ったんだろう…
msgctxt "0010 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "This must be where Kyoko got that page."
msgstr ""

#. そして、戦刃むくろのプロフィールが、
#. 俺達と一緒にファイルされていたという事は…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And since the rest of our profiles are listed in there\n"
"along with hers..."
msgstr ""

#. やはり間違いない。戦刃むくろは俺達と同じ、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園の新入生だったようだ…
msgctxt "0012 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...there can be no doubt. Mukuro was a student here at\n"
"Hope's Peak Academy, just like the rest of us."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろ…１６人目の高校生…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro Ikusaba...the sixteenth student...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>霧切さんも、これを見て、
#. その事を知ったんだろうな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That must be how Kyoko learned about it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、よっぽど時間がなかったようだな…
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "But it seems that Kyoko was in a hurry..."
msgstr ""

#. え？　なんの話？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切が、あのプロフィールを盗み出した時の話だ…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I'm talking about when she stole it."
msgstr ""

#. あの破り方や、紙のしわ具合からして、
#. 相当、慌てて持ち去った事がうかがえる…
msgctxt "0018 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The uneven tearing, the way the paper had been\n"
"crumpled, she must have been in a hurry."
msgstr ""

#. そりゃ、時間はなかっただろうね…
#. こっそり忍び込んだはずだから…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, since she snuck in to get it, I'm sure she\n"
"wanted to get out as fast as possible."
msgstr ""

#. …でも、それがどうしたの？
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But what's your point?"
msgstr ""

#. 急ぐあまり…だろうな。
#. あいつが１ページしか持ち出せなかったのは…
msgctxt "0021 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"She was in so much of a hurry...that she only got the\n"
"first page."
msgstr ""

#. １ページ…しか？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The...first page?"
msgstr ""

#. 戦刃むくろに関するプロフィールは、
#. 全部で２ページあったんだ。
msgctxt "0023 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Correct. Mukuro's profile actually contains *two*\n"
"pages."
msgstr ""

#. え…？
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、このファイルには…
msgctxt "0025 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "In other words, when it comes to this profile..."
msgstr ""

#. まだ知られていない<CLT 1>【戦刃むくろの情報】<CLT>が、
#. 残されているという事だ。
msgctxt "0026 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...there was more <CLT 1>[information about Mukuro]<CLT> that we\n"
"still didn't have."
msgstr ""

#. 【戦刃むくろの情報】
msgctxt "0027 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[information about Mukuro]"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それって…どんな情報…？
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "What kind of information is it...?"
msgstr ""

#. いちいち聞くな。自分で見てみろ。
msgctxt "0029 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Why do you ask me to explain every little thing? You\n"
"can read, can't you?"
msgstr ""

#. おそらく、学園長自身が書いた
#. <CLT 3>調査報告書<CLT>のような物だろうが…
msgctxt "0030 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It seems to be some sort of <CLT 3>detailed report<CLT> put\n"
"together by the headmaster himself."
msgstr ""

#. 希望ヶ峰学園長…どんなヤツかは知らんが、
#. なかなか面白い手掛かりを残してくれたもんだ…
msgctxt "0031 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I don't know what kind of man he was, but I'm glad he\n"
"left us such an interesting clue..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンの声を聞きながら、
#. ボクは書類の文字の上に視線を滑らせていった。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I was half-listening to Byakuya as I skimmed through\n"
"the report.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>戦刃むくろの突然の帰国…
#. その背景には、ある存在が大きく関わっているようだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0033 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Mukuro reappeared suddenly, and in the background an\n"
"entity floats, close but just out of reach.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>超高校級の絶望…と呼ばれる存在。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"The entity known as...the Ultimate Despair.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>現時点では、それが個人を指しているか、
#. 組織を指しているのかさえ不明だ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Right now, I can't be sure if this is a single\n"
"person, or some kind of group.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>だが、戦刃むくろとその存在が繋がっているのは、
#. 間違いないだろう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Whatever it is, Mukuro definitely has some sort of\n"
"connection to it.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>何か嫌な予感がする…超高校級の絶望に関する調査を
#. 早急に進める必要がありそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"I have a bad feeling about all this. I need to push\n"
"forward with my research into the Ultimate Despair.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>それと、戦刃むくろの動向にも、
#. 注意が必要と思われる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0038 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"And I need to pay attention to Mukuro's behavior,\n"
"too.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>私の勘だが、彼女は危険だ……
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"This is just my gut feeling, but I think she's\n"
"dangerous.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>彼女は、フェンリルの一員として、
#. 幾多の戦場を渡り歩いたにも関わらず…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Despite the countless battles she must have gone\n"
"through as a member of Fenrir...\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>入学時の検診の際、
#. その体には、傷らしい傷が１つもなかったらしい。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0041 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"...when she entered Hope's Peak, she didn't display\n"
"any signs of battle wounds or scars.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>その事実からも、戦刃むくろの戦闘能力の凄まじさは、
#. 容易にうかがえる。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"That fact alone proves her tremendous skill in\n"
"battle.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>生徒の１人である彼女を信じたいのは、
#. もちろんだが…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0043 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"Naturally, I want to believe in her. She's one of my\n"
"students, after all.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>万が一、彼女が他の生徒達にとって、
#. 危険な存在となるようなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0044 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"But if I decide she's a danger to the other\n"
"students...\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>それ相応の処置が、必要となるだろう。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0045 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"...I will be forced to take all reasonable measures.\"\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろ…超高校級の絶望の１人…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro...was a part of the Ultimate Despair.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、それは間違いないみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think there can be any doubt about it now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、黒幕と戦刃むくろは、
#. 仲間同士って事になるはずだけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But...wouldn't that mean Mukuro and the mastermind\n"
"were allies?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だったら、どうして…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So why...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうして、黒幕は戦刃むくろを殺したんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Why would they kill Mukuro?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、戦刃むくろには、
#. 学園長が警戒するほどの戦闘能力があったらしいけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Plus, even the headmaster seemed to be afraid of what\n"
"Mukuro was capable of.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんなヤツを殺すなんて、
#. よっぽど不意を突いたのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0052 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>They would've had to take her completely by surprise\n"
"to kill her like that...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それとも、それ以上の戦闘能力が、
#. 黒幕にあったって事か？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0053 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Or...maybe it means the mastermind is even stronger\n"
"than Mukuro was...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …どうした、苗木？
msgctxt "0054 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What's wrong, Makoto?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ？
msgctxt "0055 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 色々と考え込んでいるようだが、
#. ついでに、もう１つ教えてやろう。
msgctxt "0056 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You seem to be lost in thought. But I should probably\n"
"point out one other thing."
msgstr ""

#. このファイルで注目すべき、
#. もう１点の重要な情報をな…
msgctxt "0057 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"There's another important bit of information within\n"
"the file that you should note."
msgstr ""

#. …な、なんの事？
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What is it?"
msgstr ""

#. そのファイルの中に、
#. 写真があったのを見ただろう？
msgctxt "0059 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Did you notice the picture in there?"
msgstr ""

#. 見覚えがない女の写真だ…
msgctxt "0060 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "A picture of a girl perhaps you've never seen before?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺達７８期生の中に混じっている
#. 見覚えのない女の写真…
msgctxt "0061 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"A girl who seems to be included as part of our class\n"
"#78."
msgstr ""

#. そう考えれば、
#. この女が何者かは簡単にわかるはずだ。
msgctxt "0062 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That should be enough for you to figure out who the\n"
"girl is."
msgstr ""

#. それと、その写真の女についての情報も、
#. このファイルの中に書いてあったぞ…
msgctxt "0063 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"And further information about that girl is included in\n"
"the file."
msgstr ""

#. １６９センチ、４４キロ…それにスリーサイズもだ。
#. 上から８０・５５・８２…
msgctxt "0064 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"5 foot 7 inches, 97 pounds. And it even lists her\n"
"vitals...31-22-32."
msgstr ""

#. …どう思う？
msgctxt "0065 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well? What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どう思うって…
#. いい体だねとか…そういう事じゃないよね…？
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"What do I think? Are you asking me, like...if she has\n"
"a nice body?"
msgstr ""

#. 勘違いするな、間抜け。
#. 後で確かめておけという意味だ。
msgctxt "0067 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"You hopeless idiot. What I'm trying to tell you, is\n"
"maybe you'll want to keep that in mind for later."
msgstr ""

#. 例の死体…
#. 万が一という可能性もあるはずだぞ。
msgctxt "0068 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Maybe you'll make your way back to the corpse, and\n"
"maybe you'll think, \"Oh, could that mean...?\""
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>万が一…それってつまり…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait...is he trying to say...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>あの死体が戦刃むくろじゃない可能性…
#. そういう事だよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0070 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a chance the body isn't actually Mukuro?\n"
"Is that what he's saying?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. まさかとは思うが、
#. 念の為にも調べておいた方が良さそうだ…
msgctxt "0071 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Personally, what I'm thinking seems all but\n"
"impossible. But it wouldn't hurt to confirm, right?"
msgstr ""

#. …という訳だ。任せるぞ。
msgctxt "0072 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"That's all I was trying to say. What you do with that\n"
"information is your business."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり…パシリ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I'm back to being Byakuya's errand boy...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>戦刃むくろのプロフィール<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Mukuro's Profile<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. それと、お前にはもう１つ言っておく事がある。
msgctxt "0075 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Oh, and one last thing..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺からの<CLT 1>【忠告】<CLT>だ。
#. ありがたく聞いておいた方がいいぞ…
msgctxt "0076 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's a bit of <CLT 1>[advice]<CLT> from me to you, so I suggest\n"
"you pay attention."
msgstr ""

#. 【忠告】
msgctxt "0077 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "[advice]"
msgstr ""

#. ボクに…忠告って？
msgctxt "0078 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Advice...for me?"
msgstr ""

#. お前は随分、霧切と仲良くしているようだが…
msgctxt "0079 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You seem to be getting along with Kyoko quite well."
msgstr ""

#. 仲良くって言うか…
#. 霧切さんには色々と助けてもらったし…
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It's not that we're getting along. She's just done a\n"
"lot to help me..."
msgstr ""

#. あいつを信じ過ぎない方がいい…
msgctxt "0081 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well, don't put too much faith in her."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. そうでないと、
#. 手痛いしっぺ返しを食らう羽目になるかもな…
msgctxt "0083 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"The cost of that faith might be more than you can\n"
"afford."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして…そんな事…？
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Wh-What are you saying...?"
msgstr ""

#. …俺の勘だ。
msgctxt "0085 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Just what I think. Call it a hunch."
msgstr ""

#. か、勘って…
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "A hunch..."
msgstr ""

#. だが、俺の勘はよく当たるんだ。
#. 信じる信じないは、お前の自由だがな…
msgctxt "0087 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But my hunches tend to be proven right. The advice is\n"
"free this time. Take it or don't, as you will."
msgstr ""

#. う、うん…
#. 一応…聞いておくよ…
msgctxt "0088 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I-I'll keep it in mind. Thanks..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0089 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>ここが学園長室か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0090 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the headmaster's room...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>話には聞いてたけど、
#. 実際に入るのは初めてだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0091 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I've heard an awful lot about it, but this'll be my\n"
"first time seeing it for myself...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木、お前も来たのか…
msgctxt "0092 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Ah, Makoto. It's you..."
msgstr ""

#. あ…十神クン…
msgctxt "0093 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, Byakuya."
msgstr ""

#. それにしても、ちょうどいい所に来たじゃないか。
#. <CLT 1>【面白い物】<CLT>を見せてやるよ…
msgctxt "0094 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, you came to the right place this time. Would you\n"
"like to see <CLT 1>[something interesting]<CLT>?"
msgstr ""

#. つまり、このファイルには…
msgctxt "0095 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "In other words, when it comes to this profile..."
msgstr ""

#. まだ知られていない<CLT 1>【戦刃むくろの情報】<CLT>が、
#. 残されているという事だ。
msgctxt "0096 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"...there's more <CLT 1>[information about Mukuro]<CLT> that we\n"
"still don't have."
msgstr ""

#. お前にはもう１つ言っておく事がある。
#. 俺からの<CLT 1>【忠告】<CLT>だ。ありがたく聞いておけ…
msgctxt "0097 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I have one more thing to say. It's a bit of <CLT 1>[advice]<CLT>\n"
"from me to you, so I suggest you pay attention."
msgstr ""

#. ねぇ、十神クン…
msgctxt "0098 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Hey, Byakuya..."
msgstr ""

#. これ以上、お前の相手をしているヒマはない。
#. お喋りがしたいなら、他を当たれ…
msgctxt "0099 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I don't have time to waste on you right now. If you\n"
"absolutely must talk, go do it at someone else."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>けんもほろろ…
#. 取り付く島もない…ってヤツか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0100 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>God, he's so blunt, it just makes you feel...hopeless.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長室にも…
#. このモニターがあるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0101 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even in the headmaster's room, there's a monitor...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>学園長室にも…
#. この監視カメラがあるのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0102 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Even in the headmaster's room, there's a surveillance\n"
"camera...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おい…苗木…
msgctxt "0103 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hey, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. この俺を無視するなど…
#. お前如きに許されているとでも？
msgctxt "0104 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Are you ignoring me? You think I'll forgive that just\n"
"because you're you?"
msgstr ""

#. ここから出た後…覚えておけよ…
msgctxt "0105 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "When we get out of here, remember this moment..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>第７８期生…在学生名簿…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0106 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Class #78...Student Registry...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どうやら、第７８期生とは、
#. ボク達の事を指しているらしい…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0107 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Apparently, that's us.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここにはボク達１５人と
#. 戦刃むくろのプロフィールがファイルされている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0108 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It has profiles on me and everyone I met at the\n"
"beginning...and Mukuro.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>やっぱり、戦刃むくろはボク達と同じ、
#. 希望ヶ峰学園の新入生だったんだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0109 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Just like us, Mukuro was apparently a new student here\n"
"at Hope's Peak...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろ…超高校級の絶望の１人…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0110 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Mukuro Ikusaba...part of the Ultimate Despair...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると…黒幕と戦刃むくろは、
#. 仲間同士って事になるはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0111 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which means her and the mastermind should have been\n"
"allies.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、だったら…
#. どうして、黒幕は戦刃むくろを殺したんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0112 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But then...why would the mastermind kill her?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>仲間だったはずなのに…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0113 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Weren't they...friends?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>床に書類が散らばっている…
#. なんか、無残だな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0114 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are documents scattered all over the floor.\n"
"Somehow it makes me feel...anxious.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ショーケースだ…
#. トロフィーや盾が飾られている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0115 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There are trophies and even a shield in the display\n"
"case.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もの凄く立派な本棚だ…
#. 分厚い本やファイルが置かれている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0116 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The bookshelf seems really well made, and it's filled\n"
"with files and thick books.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. おい…苗木…
msgctxt "0117 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hey, Makoto."
msgstr ""

#. この俺を無視するなど…
#. お前如きに許されているとでも？
msgctxt "0118 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Are you ignoring me? You think I'll forgive that just\n"
"because you're you?"
msgstr ""

#. ここから出た後…覚えておけよ…
msgctxt "0119 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "When we get out of here, remember this moment..."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0120 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0121 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0122 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
